			<Folder>
				<name>Concord - Green Valley</name>
				<Placemark id="khPlacemark43465">
					<name>Concord - Green Valley Fault</name>
					<Snippet maxLines="0" id="khSnippet43625"></Snippet>
					<description><![CDATA[<p>Slip on the Calaveras fault to the south steps over to the Concord-Green Valley in the city of Concord, where evidence of fault creep can be seen.  The fault passes 10 miles east of Napa.</p>]]></description>
