			<Folder>
				<name>Greenville</name>
				<Placemark id="khPlacemark43503">
					<name>Greenville Fault</name>
					<Snippet maxLines="0" id="khSnippet43504"></Snippet>
					<description><![CDATA[<p>The source of the 1980 Livermore Earthquake (magnitude 5.8) and minor earthquakes since, the Greenville fault includes several active segments along its 70km trace.  It is a strike-slip
fault with right-lateral movement.</br>
For more information: <a href="http://erp-web.er.usgs.gov/reports/abstract/1997/nc/g3146.htm">Greenville Fault</a> </p>]]></description>
